- **Potential SSRF via Markdown Links**: CWE-918 (Server-Side Request Forgery) - Medium Confidence
- **Code Injection via Markdown Extensions**: CWE-78 (Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an OS Command ('OS Command Injection') or CWE-94 (Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')) - Low to Medium Confidence

