The function directly formats user inputs (`inverter_serial`, `ts`, `status`, `etoday`, `etotal`) into the SQL query string using Python's string formatting operator (`%`). This approach does not sanitize or parameterize the input values, allowing an attacker to inject arbitrary SQL code.

