SELECT id, name, video_position from playlist WHERE id=1 OR 1=1;
```
This could cause the query to return all rows in the `playlist` table instead of just the intended one.

Additionally, there is no indication that proper error handling or logging is implemented. This lack of robustness can lead to further issues if an attacker attempts to exploit the vulnerability.
