- CWE-89 (SQL Injection) - High Confidence
- CWE-532 (Information Exposure Through Logging) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-759 (Improper Check for Unusual or Exceptional Conditions) - Medium Confidence

These issues should be addressed to enhance the security and robustness of the application.

