   CWE: CWE-264 - Medium Confidence

3. Lack of Input Validation - There is no input validation for the pagename parameter. This might lead to unexpected behavior if the user enters special characters or invalid values that could cause issues with the functionality of the link dialog.
   CWE: CWE-13 - Low Confidence
</analysis>

