   ```
   This could lead to:
   ```sql
   INSERT INTO MonthData (TimeStamp, Serial, DayYield, TotalYield) VALUES (1633024800, '' OR '1'='1', 1000, 5000);
   ```
   Which is a syntax error in SQL but demonstrates how the input can be manipulated to inject malicious SQL.

