CWEs: CWE-269 (Incomplete Exception Handling) - High Confidence, CWE-400 (Uncontrolled Resource Consumption) - Medium Confidence, CWE-444 (Insufficient Input Validation) - Medium Confidence, CWE-22/119 (Improper Restriction of Operations within Bound Checking) - Low Confidence, CWE-388 (Inconsistent Use of Time-outs) - Medium Confidence
</analysis>

