* CWE-284: Improper Access Control - Medium-High Confidence
* CWE-601: Open Redirect - Low-Medium Confidence
* CWE-89: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting') - Low-Medium Confidence

