- CWE-89 (SQL Injection) - High Confidence
- CWE-256 (Unprotected Storage of Credentials) - High Confidence
- CWE-269 (Potential Privilege Escalation) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-200 (Potential Information Disclosure) - Low Confidence

