- CWEs: CWE-89 (SQL Injection) - High Confidence, CWE-256 (Unprotected Storage of Credentials) - Medium Confidence, CWE-119 (Exception Handling Errors) - Low Confidence, CWE-532 (Logging Sensitive Information) - Low Confidence

**Recommendations:** 

1. **Parameterized Queries:** Switch to using parameterized queries or prepared statements for database operations.
