- CWE-97 (Improper Usage of Modifying External Links) or CWE-78 (Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation (Cross-site Scripting)) are not directly applicable here. However, the code does involve data queries and URL processing which might have some indirect implications.
</analysis>

