CWEs: 
- CWE-78 (Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Output Used by a Downstream Component ('Injection')) - High Confidence for command injection.
- CWE-532 (Incorrectly Implemented Interprocess Communication) - Medium Confidence due to reliance on SSH and potential mishandling.
</analysis>

