1. **SQL Injection Vulnerability (CWE-89):**
   - In the line `sql = "SELECT DISTINCT scene FROM ranks WHERE player='{}'".format(tag)`, user input (`tag`) is directly interpolated into an SQL query without any sanitization or parameterization.
