- CWE-532 (Incorrectly Prepared Queries): Low Confidence, as it is related to the lack of prepared statements or parameterized queries which indirectly relate to preventing injection attacks.

Overall confidence in these assessments is high due to the clear and well-documented nature of SQL injection vulnerabilities and their potential impact on database security.
</analysis>

